WEBVTT

00:05:28.076 --> 00:05:30.236
He's an Oxford graduate in physics

00:05:30.276 --> 00:05:33.996
that decided to set up his own
betting syndicate in North London,

00:05:33.996 --> 00:05:37.316
basically an office
full of PhD statisticians

00:05:37.316 --> 00:05:40.516
calculating the probabilities
for the outcome of football games.

00:05:40.916 --> 00:05:42.676
That has made him a rich man.

00:05:42.676 --> 00:05:46.356
So rich, he decided to buy
the football club

00:05:46.396 --> 00:05:48.476
he supported since he was a teenager:

00:05:48.476 --> 00:05:50.676
Brentford in West London.

00:05:50.676 --> 00:05:52.796
And that's where I met him five years ago,

00:05:52.796 --> 00:05:55.636
at Jersey Road, the training
ground of Brentford.

00:05:56.076 --> 00:05:59.116
At the time we met,
Brentford was third in League One,

00:05:59.116 --> 00:06:01.316
which is the third tier
of English football.